      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To navigate the conflicting clauses, gather all relevant documents, including your survey, proposed changes, and the municipal code. Consult with a land use attorney who specializes in Austin's zoning laws to get clarity on setback requirements and strategies for overcoming encroachment issues. Coordinate with the neighboring property owners to potentially resolve overhang or boundary discrepancies informally. Document all communication and be prepared to provide a reasonable remedy for the encroachment problem when submitting the reclassification application to the zoning board. Finally, engaging a local land use professional or urban planner might help to navigate the rezoning process and anticipate the board's concerns or objections.",
